I posted earlier asking about what good staying in your alignment is. Well,
I've partially just answered my own question.  My prayer time out was 
definitely over, but after robbing a shop with the help of about forty 
little jackal friends, my alignment was pretty low. A giant mimic had a hold
of me (he doesn't attack you while you're a jackal, etc.) and I was down to
three hp. I prayed, and a black glow went over me.  I died, and it said
I had strayed from my alignment.  So, in extreme cases, I guess your god
may ignore you or punish you if you aren't following your alignment.  But
what happens when you're really, extremely true to your alignment?  I'd
still like to know that.
